From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gerard Marull-Paretas <gerard@teslabs.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:52:08 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: arm: cpus: Add Cortex-M33

Document the compatible of the Arm Cortex-M33 core, next to the other
Cortex-M cores already listed.

These schemas are now used by PebbleOS, whose QEMU machines are built
around a Cortex-M33.
---
 arm/cpus.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/arm/cpus.yaml b/arm/cpus.yaml
index 96136b70dacd..da12be7f5119 100644
--- a/arm/cpus.yaml
+++ b/arm/cpus.yaml
@@ -170,6 +170,7 @@ properties:
           - arm,cortex-m1
           - arm,cortex-m3
           - arm,cortex-m4
+          - arm,cortex-m33
           - arm,cortex-r4
           - arm,cortex-r5
           - arm,cortex-r7
